%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"background":"#ffffff","primaryColor":"#e8f1ff","primaryTextColor":"#1f2937","primaryBorderColor":"#3b82f6","lineColor":"#4b5563","secondaryColor":"#f1e8ff","tertiaryColor":"#fff7d6","fontFamily":"Arial, sans-serif"},"sequence":{"useMaxWidth":true,"diagramMarginX":25,"diagramMarginY":18,"actorMargin":32,"width":160,"height":60,"boxMargin":8,"messageMargin":24,"noteMargin":10}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Reporter as Active verified PART
    participant UI as ReportAbuseModal
    participant API as Reporting API
    participant Service as Reporting service
    participant Repos as Target and moderation repositories
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Reporter->>UI: Open report for visible target
    UI->>UI: Require category and validate URL or explanation
    UI->>API: POST /api/reports
    API->>API: Require Firebase, MFA, active verified PART
    API->>Service: Submit normalized report
    Service->>Repos: Resolve eligible team, profile, event, or URL owner
    Repos->>DB: Query visible target
    DB-->>Repos: Eligible target or unavailable
    Repos-->>Service: Visibility-safe result
    Service->>Repos: Count reporter submissions in rolling hour
    Repos->>DB: Query recent reports
    DB-->>Repos: Reports used
    Service->>Repos: Link open case or create case
    Service->>Repos: Persist private report
    Repos->>DB: Insert moderation case and report state
    DB-->>Service: Report receipt metadata
    Service-->>API: Participant-safe confirmation
    API-->>UI: 201 Received and remaining quota
    UI-->>Reporter: Success receipt

    alt Invalid, invisible, or rate limited
        Service-->>API: Safe validation, not-found, or retry error
        API-->>UI: No report created
        UI-->>Reporter: Preserve form and show guidance
    end

    Note over Service,Reporter: Participants cannot list reports or receive ADMIN notes,<br/>evidence, action history, or other reporters' data.

